  "contentHtml": "<main><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container reveal\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">NIGHT FANMEETING · 2030.07.06</span><h1 class=\"section-title\">NIGHT IN THE HOUSE</h1><p class=\"section-desc\">NIGHT와 LUNA가 한집에 모인 특별한 하루. 토크와 게임, 코스프레, 스페셜 스테이지와 앵콜까지 팬미팅의 모든 순간을 기록합니다.</p><p class=\"archive-count\">OFFICIAL PHOTO ARCHIVE · 63 IMAGES</p><nav class=\"listen-jump-nav\" aria-label=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE 바로가기\"><a href=\"#visuals\">VISUALS</a><a href=\"#part-1\">PART 1</a><a href=\"#part-2\">PART 2</a><a href=\"#encore\">ENCORE</a></nav></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"visuals\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">OFFICIAL VISUALS</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">WELCOME HOME</h2></div><div class=\"gallery-grid\"><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-2030-fanmeeting-poster.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-2030-fanmeeting-poster.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE 2030 Fanmeeting Poster\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>01 · 2030 Fanmeeting Poster</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-night.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-night.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Night\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>02 · Night</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-doha.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-doha.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Doha\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>03 · Doha</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-woohyun.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-woohyun.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Woohyun\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>04 · Woohyun</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-jiwoo.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-jiwoo.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Jiwoo\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>05 · Jiwoo</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Ihwan\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>06 · Ihwan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Taehoon\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>07 · Taehoon</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"part-1\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">FANMEETING</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">PART 1</h2><p class=\"section-desc\">오프닝과 토크, LUNA와 함께한 게임의 순간.</p></div><div class=\"gallery-grid\"><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-opening.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-opening.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Opening\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>01 · Opening</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-talk.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-talk.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Talk\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>02 · Talk</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Night In The House Part 1\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>03 · Night In The House Part 1</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">맞아. 나 게으르긴 해.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">무대에서는 부지런한 녀석이 숙소에선 제일 늦게 나와요.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE 2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>04 · 2</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">나? 내가 왜?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">그걸 몰라서 묻냐?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">유태훈, 너만 조용하면 아무도 말 안 해.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-3.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE 3\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>05 · 3</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">대충대충 하는 것 같아도 지우는 스케줄 있는 날은 제일 부지런해요.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">맞아. 준비도 제일 빨라.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">그러고 나서 차에서 잠드는 것도 제일 빨라요.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-balloon-pop-game-jiwoo-x-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-balloon-pop-game-jiwoo-x-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Balloon Pop Game Jiwoo × Ihwan\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>06 · Balloon Pop Game Jiwoo × Ihwan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-balloon-pop-game-woohyun-x-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-balloon-pop-game-woohyun-x-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Balloon Pop Game Woohyun × Taehoon\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>07 · Balloon Pop Game Woohyun × Taehoon</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Game\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>08 · Game</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Game 2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>09 · Game 2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-cut-blindfold-guess-doha-woohyun.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-cut-blindfold-guess-doha-woohyun.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Game Cut Blindfold Guess Doha Woohyun\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>10 · Game Cut Blindfold Guess Doha Woohyun</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">성우현이네.</span></p><p class=\"event-note\">우현이 도하가 만지자마자 웃음을 터뜨려 도하가 바로 알아맞힌 상황.</p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-cut-blindfold-guess-taehoon-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-game-cut-blindfold-guess-taehoon-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Game Cut Blindfold Guess Taehoon Ihwan\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>11 · Game Cut Blindfold Guess Taehoon Ihwan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-pepero-game-doha-x-jiwoo.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-pepero-game-doha-x-jiwoo.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Pepero Game Doha × Jiwoo\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>12 · Pepero Game Doha × Jiwoo</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">형? 너무 가깝지 않아요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">가만히 있어. 조금 더 짧게 가야지.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">아. 도하 형, 승부욕. 진짜.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-pepero-game-woohyun-x-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-1-pepero-game-woohyun-x-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Pepero Game Woohyun × Ihwan\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>13 · Pepero Game Woohyun × Ihwan</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-note\">둘이 얼굴을 마주보자마자 웃음이 터져 빼빼로가 금방 부러짐.</p></div></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"part-2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">FANMEETING</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">PART 2</h2><p class=\"section-desc\">코스프레와 유닛 무대, 스페셜 스테이지로 이어진 두 번째 이야기.</p></div><div class=\"gallery-grid\"><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-opening.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-opening.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Opening\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>01 · Opening</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Stage\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>02 · Stage</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Stage2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>03 · Stage2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage-doha-x-jiwoo.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage-doha-x-jiwoo.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Stage Doha × Jiwoo\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>04 · Stage Doha × Jiwoo</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage-woohyun-x-ihwan-x-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-stage-woohyun-x-ihwan-x-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Stage Woohyun × Ihwan × Taehoon\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>05 · Stage Woohyun × Ihwan × Taehoon</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Mirror Stage\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>06 · Mirror Stage</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage-after-talk.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage-after-talk.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Mirror Stage After Talk\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>07 · Mirror Stage After Talk</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">LUNA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">우현아, 지우야. 이거 누구 아이디어였어?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">이거 회사에서 시켜서 한 거예요. 저희가 하자고 한 거 아니에요.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">네, 시켜서 했는데요? 무슨 문제라도?</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage-after-talk2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-stage-after-talk2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Mirror Stage After Talk2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>08 · Mirror Stage After Talk2</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">형들 언제부터 그런 사이였어요? ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO & WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">유태훈, 조용히 해.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">아, 태훈이는 이때 없어서 처음 보는구나?</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-doha-x-taehoon-ver.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-mirror-doha-x-taehoon-ver.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Mirror Doha × Taehoon Ver\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>09 · Mirror Doha × Taehoon Ver</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">LUNA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">태훈아! 너도 도하랑 똑같이 해줘!</span></p><p class=\"event-action\">(포즈 후)</p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">아, 형들 이거 어떻게 한 거예요? 그런데 도하 형은 왜 아무렇지 않은 건데요. ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">팬분들이 원하시니까? 별로 상관없는데.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>10 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-ending.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-ending.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan Ending\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>11 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan Ending</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>12 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">LUNA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">이환아, 너 여장 싫어하잖아. 왜 또 했어?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">사실 헤드윅 캐스팅 들어왔다고 회사에서 하래요.</span></p><p class=\"event-action\">(얼굴 가림)</p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">예쁜데 왜 그래?</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk1.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk1\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>13 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk1</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">이환이 형, 만져봐도 돼요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">(태훈이 뒷덜미를 잡고) 되겠냐? 가만히 좀 있어.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ 아, 배 아파.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>14 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk2</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-action\">이환이 환복하러 간 사이</p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">사실 저 웃음 참느라 죽는 줄 알았어요.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">형, 연습할 때랑 무대 때는 안 웃었잖아요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">너희는 연습 때부터 웃느라 못 하니까 내가 한 거지.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-special-stage-doha-x-ihwan-after-talk3.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk3\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>15 · Special Stage Doha × Ihwan After Talk3</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-action\">이환 환복 후</p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">형, 저 다 들었거든요? 너무한 거 아니에요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">그게 들렸어?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">IHWAN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">마이크 켜져 있어서 옷 갈아입는데 다 들리던데요?</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-doha.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-doha.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Doha\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>16 · Cosplay Doha</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-woohyun.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-woohyun.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Woohyun\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>17 · Cosplay Woohyun</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Jiwoo\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>18 · Cosplay Jiwoo</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-ihwan.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-ihwan.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Ihwan\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>19 · Cosplay Ihwan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Taehoon\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>20 · Cosplay Taehoon</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-woohyun-x-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-woohyun-x-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Woohyun × Taehoon\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>21 · Cosplay Woohyun × Taehoon</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">크앙! 하늘다람쥐 잡아먹어야지.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">유태훈. 그만 따라와!!</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-taehoon2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-taehoon2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Taehoon2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>22 · Cosplay Taehoon2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-ihwan2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-ihwan2.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Ihwan2\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>23 · Cosplay Ihwan2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-doha-x-taehoon.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-doha-x-taehoon.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Doha × Taehoon\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>24 · Cosplay Doha × Taehoon</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">범인은 도하 형이야!</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">근거가 뭔데?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">TAEHOON</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">그냥 감이야.</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">DOHA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">난 형사인데?</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo-x-woohyun.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo-x-woohyun.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Jiwoo × Woohyun\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>25 · Cosplay Jiwoo × Woohyun</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">LUNA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">우현이 지우가 키우는 애완동물이야?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">그런 거 아니에요. 저 사람이거든요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">얌전히 안겨 있어요. 형.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo-x-woohyun1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay-jiwoo-x-woohyun1.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay Jiwoo × Woohyun1\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>26 · Cosplay Jiwoo × Woohyun1</figcaption><div class=\"event-log\" aria-label=\"현장 기록\"><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">LUNA</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">MIRROR 무대 엔딩 포즈 다시 해줘!</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">WOOHYUN</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">이 상태로요?</span></p><p class=\"event-line\"><strong class=\"event-speaker\">JIWOO</strong><span class=\"event-dialogue\">네, 해드릴게요.</span></p></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-cosplay.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Cosplay\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figcaption>27 · Cosplay</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><a href=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-ending-stage.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANMEETING-NIGHT-IN-THE-HOUSE/night-in-the-house-part-2-ending-stage.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT IN THE HOUSE Ending Stage\" loading=\"eager\"></a><figca